 song of zombies, which smells of death, eats away at the human soul.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to pass through poisonous gases. Fight with intelligent space robots that have come to earth and save humanity. You have to cross the dragon's territory to save </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                          </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENEMYES</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >zombie  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter zombies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying and fire-throwing dragons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various monsters that crawl on two legs or four arms </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rats and big spiders </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien robots with laser weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying robots with cannons and laser weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meat trees with toxic gases </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you see blood splattering around with every shot. You use different weapons to kill enemies. You can destroy enemies in groups by throwing grenades and shooting barrels and explosive gas capsules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break wooden crates and loot chests and backpacks to collect ammo and health packs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031980/extras/0b2c3a335fe9e1651925fb2169106ba8.poster.avif?t=1751935205\" width=320 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031980/extras/0b2c3a335fe9e1651925fb2169106ba8.webm?t=1751935205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"